 in southeastern Colorado...\n\n* WHEN...Until 900 AM MDT Tuesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Flooding will occur in low-lying and flood-prone\nlocations is imminent or occurring.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...\n- At 852 AM MDT, flooding was occurring along the Rio Grande River\nin low lying and agricultural areas. This high water is due to\nall of the heavy rain which occurred over the last couple of\ndays.\n- Some locations that will experience flooding include low lying\nareas in parts of Alamosa and parts of Conejos counties.\n- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood","ends":"2026-10-27T09:00:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Alamosa, CO; Conejos, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.596148dc4b6e7104cce02aa2eaee388cb3f30324.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.596148dc4b6e7104cce02aa2eaee388cb3f30324.001.1"}],"afd":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-10-26T11:21:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FXUS65 KPUB 261121 AFDPUB Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Pueblo CO 521 AM MDT Mon Oct 26 2026 .KEY MESSAGES... - Drier and warmer starting today, lasting through most of the week. - Pattern change arrives this weekend, bringing cooler and more active weather to the region again. && .SHORT TERM /THROUGH TONIGHT/... Issued at 1258 AM MDT Mon Oct 26 2026 Any lingering showers o","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=PUB&issuedby=PUB&product=AFD&format=CI"},"hwo":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-10-26T15:12:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FLUS45 KPUB 261512 HWOPUB Hazardous Weather Outlook National Weather Service Pueblo CO 912 AM MDT Mon Oct 26 2026 COZ058>089-093>099-271300- Western Mosquito Range/East Lake County Above 11000 Feet- Leadville Vicinity/Lake County Below 11000 Feet- Eastern Sawatch Mountains Above 11000 Feet- Western Chaffee County Between 9000 and 11000 Feet- Central Chaffee County Below 9000 Feet- Western Mosq","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=PUB&issuedby=PUB&product=HWO&format=CI"},"fwf":{"office":"PUB","issu